      612   DEFINE FRAME Dialog-Frame
      613        B-exit AT ROW 1 COL 1
      614        B-quit AT ROW 1 COL 11
      615        B-Help AT ROW 1 COL 88
      616        B-6 AT ROW 2.25 COL 3.63 WIDGET-ID 90
      617        ass-srokiztdel AT ROW 2.25 COL 4.63 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 190
      618        crit-srokgod AT ROW 3.25 COL 4.5 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 192
      619        B-7 AT ROW 3.29 COL 3.63 WIDGET-ID 194
      620        B-8 AT ROW 4.25 COL 3.5 WIDGET-ID 202
      621        ass-num-days-igt AT ROW 4.25 COL 4.5 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 204
      622        B-9 AT ROW 5.25 COL 3.5 WIDGET-ID 210
      623        ass-proc-matr-shabl AT ROW 5.25 COL 4.5 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 208
      624        v-ass-srokiztdel AT ROW 2.25 COL 20 NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 78
      625        v-crit-srokgod AT ROW 3.29 COL 20 NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 198
      626        v-Ass-Num-days-igt AT ROW 4.25 COL 20 NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 206
      627        v-Ass-proc-matr-shabl AT ROW 5.25 COL 20.5 NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 214
      628        I-ass-srokiztdel AT ROW 2.25 COL 1 WIDGET-ID 72
      629        I-crit-srokgod AT ROW 3.29 COL 1 WIDGET-ID 196
      630        I-ass-num-days-igt AT ROW 4.25 COL 1 WIDGET-ID 200
      631        I-ass-proc-matr-shabl AT ROW 5.25 COL 1 WIDGET-ID 212
      632        SPACE(94.74) SKIP(15.96)
      633       WITH VIEW-AS DIALOG-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER
      634            SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D  SCROLLABLE
      635            TITLE "Настройки Ассортиментной политики"
      636            DEFAULT-BUTTON B-exit CANCEL-BUTTON B-quit WIDGET-ID 100.
      637   ASSIGN
      638          FRAME Dialog-Frame:SCROLLABLE       = FALSE
      639          FRAME Dialog-Frame:HIDDEN           = TRUE.
      640   ASSIGN
      641          v-Ass-Num-days-igt:READ-ONLY IN FRAME Dialog-Frame        = TRUE.
      642   ASSIGN
      643          v-Ass-proc-matr-shabl:READ-ONLY IN FRAME Dialog-Frame        = TRUE.
      644   ASSIGN
      645          v-ass-srokiztdel:READ-ONLY IN FRAME Dialog-Frame        = TRUE.
      646   ASSIGN
      647          v-crit-srokgod:READ-ONLY IN FRAME Dialog-Frame        = TRUE.
      648   ON GO OF FRAME Dialog-Frame
      649   DO:
      650     run save-proc in this-procedure no-error.
      651     if error-status :error then return no-apply.
      652   END.
      653   ON WINDOW-CLOSE OF FRAME Dialog-Frame
      654   DO:
      655     APPLY "END-ERROR":U TO SELF.
      656   END.
      657   ON CHOOSE OF B-6 IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
